		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7a034b5d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="7a034b5d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-256b33ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="256b33ec" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-11d23a52 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="11d23a52" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why hair salon marketing <span class="hl">isn't the same as marketing "a beauty salon"</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-56405e15 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="56405e15" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-75114e5c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="75114e5c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-42b4592c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="42b4592c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A specialist hair salon is built around colour, chemical treatments and precision cutting. It sells differently from a general multi-service salon. The client isn&#8217;t choosing a location. They&#8217;re choosing a stylist, based on transformations they&#8217;ve already seen. That&#8217;s why SEO for hair salons needs stylist pages, treatment pages and a strong Google profile, not one generic page.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-73252ee6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="73252ee6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Instagram marketing for hair salons starts with the stylist's page</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6e40f21e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6e40f21e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>By the time a color client calls or messages, they&#8217;ve usually already picked which stylist they want. Marketing that pushes &#8220;the salon&#8221; as a brand, without giving each stylist their own visible portfolio and following, is marketing the wrong thing.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-71293fb6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="71293fb6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Hair salon rebooking cycles vary by service</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1c101e80 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1c101e80" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A cut-and-blow-dry client rebooks every 4-6 weeks; a full-color client rebooks every 6-8 weeks; a keratin client rebooks every 3-5 months. A single generic &#8220;come back soon&#8221; campaign misses all three cycles at once — each needs its own timed prompt.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3bded46e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="3bded46e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7092aa94 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7092aa94" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Hair salons, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">AED 250-2,200</b><span>— real Dubai price range for color/keratin work</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">68%*</b><span>— clients who check a stylist&#8217;s Instagram before booking</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">6-8 wks</b><span>— typical color-client rebooking cycle</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">3-5 mo</b><span>— typical keratin-client rebooking cycle</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2ab24039 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="2ab24039" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
