				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2cb6c230 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2cb6c230" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="text-align:center;font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>FAQs</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15a1bea7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="15a1bea7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Hair salon marketing agency FAQs — <span class="hl">before you ask</span></h2>				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2f2b12c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2f2b12c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-333b78ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion" data-id="333b78ed" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="accordion.default">
							<div class="elementor-accordion">
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-8591" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="1" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-8591" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How is this different from your Beauty Salons page?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-8591" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-8591"><p>Beauty Salons covers the broader multi-format category — hair, nails, brows, barbershops, unisex. This page is specifically for hair-specialist salons where color, chemical treatments and cutting are the core business, and marketing has to be stylist-led rather than location-led.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-8592" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="2" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-8592" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How is this different from your Hair Extension Studios page?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-8592" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-8592"><p>Hair Extension Studios covers businesses where extensions are the primary service. This page covers full-service hair salons where extensions, if offered, are one add-on service alongside color and cutting — sold to existing clients, not acquired standalone.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-8593" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="3" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-8593" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Why do you build portfolio pages for individual stylists?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-8593" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-8593"><p>Because clients in this category choose a colorist or stylist first, and the salon second. A stylist with a visible, well-promoted portfolio converts consultation requests far better than a single generic salon page ever will.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-8594" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="4" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-8594" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">We have several stylists with very different rebooking cycles — can you handle that?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-8594" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-8594"><p>Yes — cut clients, color clients and keratin clients rebook on completely different timelines (4-6 weeks, 6-8 weeks, and 3-5 months respectively), and we time review requests and rebooking prompts to each cycle separately.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-8595" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="5" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-8595" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-left" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><svg class="e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus" viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Do you handle bridal and event hair bookings differently?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-8595" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="5" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-8595"><p>Yes — the trial-then-event booking model needs its own deposit-aware scheduling flow and seasonal wedding-season ad strategy, distinct from everyday appointment bookings.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-8596" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="6" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-8596" aria-expanded="false">
